<p>The final turn locks the current calculated tier, creates a quote reference, sets <code>completed: true</code>, and leaves the accepted tier in <code>QuoteNode</code> state.</p>

<h2 id="under-the-hood">Under the hood</h2>
<p>The transcript shows what the customer saw. This table shows which nodes ran, which tools changed state or moved the conversation, and who wrote each reply. The replay records replies rather than tool calls, so the tool column is inferred from each reply and the node code. Turns 14 and 15 match the code's templates word for word.</p>
<table>
