  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>Hi, I'd like a quote…</td><td>DriverNode</td><td>—</td><td>model</td></tr>
    <tr><td>2</td><td>Jamie Rivera, born April 12, 1993.</td><td>DriverNode</td><td>—</td><td>model</td></tr>
    <tr><td>3</td><td>Licensed in Oregon, valid license, for about 10 years.</td><td>DriverNode → VehicleNode</td><td><code>capture_driver</code> → <code>go(VehicleNode)</code></td><td>model (VehicleNode)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>4</td><td>It's a 2019 Toyota Camry.</td><td>VehicleNode</td><td><code>resolve_vehicle</code> → <code>stay()</code> with three trims</td><td>model</td></tr>
    <tr><td>5</td><td>The SE trim.</td><td>VehicleNode</td><td><code>resolve_vehicle</code> with a trim → <code>stay()</code>, one vehicle resolved</td><td>model</td></tr>
